{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.10] Yeah, I told slatt I'm finna talk some shit, man\n[00:04.76] We throwin' P's in this bitch, man\n[00:06.32] Throwin' L's in this bitch, man\n[00:08.54] And we throwin' shells in this bitch\n[Chorus]\n[00:11.70] I'm with my nigga from the Nolia and he down to let it spark\n[00:14.12] I forgot to mention that my bitch got a AR\n[00:17.62] Got a couple lil' tools, put you in the graveyard\n[00:20.56] Short barrel AR, but it got a big bark\n[00:23.48] These ain't no .22 bullets, they leave more than a scar, boy\n[00:26.84] Hit you up like Lavagirl and leave you swimmin' like Sharkboy\n[00:29.56] From the Nolia to Chicago, we'll be down to let it spark, boy\n[00:32.72] Rifle bullets so sharp, thought I hit you with a dart, boy\n[Verse 1]\n[00:36.16] Best not let me catch you walking through the park, boy\n[00:38.98] Big bro keep two revolvers, he a cowboy\n[00:42.00] Leave you with a shit bag, you got bloody farts, boy\n[00:45.00] Infrared dots, let me get you in the dark, boy\n[00:47.86] I ain't gon' say too much, I'm 'bout the action\n[00:50.96] Lost my brother so I'm never with the lackin'\n[00:53.94] Shit get bloody, real bloody, no napkin\n[00:56.98] We was getting scummy for the money, makin' it happen\n[00:59.90] Grrah, I unload the clip, uh\n[01:01.76] I ain't going to throw no fist at all, you can suck a dick, uh\n[01:04.84] Bullets pin you to the wall, you a poster, kid, uh\n[01:07.84] Should've stayed your ass in school like you 'posed to, kid\n[01:10.82] Twelve gauge shotty, I been on my trucker shit, uh\n[01:13.70] SK, no karate, let that motherfucker kick\n[01:16.48] Back in the day, I ain't trap on text, hit me on my Kik, uh\n[01:19.84] Feds ain't catchin' shit, uh\n[01:21.34] Treat this gun like this brick, I'm gon' get that bitch off\n[Chorus]\n[01:24.20] I'm with my nigga from the Nolia and he down to let it spark\n[01:26.62] I forgot to mention that my bitch got a AR\n[01:29.62] Got a couple lil' tools, put you in the graveyard\n[01:32.56] Short barrel AR, but it got a big bark\n[01:35.48] These ain't no .22 bullets, they leave more than a scar, boy\n[01:38.60] Hit you up like Lavagirl and leave you swimmin' like Sharkboy\n[01:41.60] From the Nolia to Chicago, we'll be down to let it spark, boy\n[01:44.72] Rifle bullets so sharp, thought I hit you with a dart, boy\n[Verse 2]\n[01:47.58] From the Nolia to Chicago, got 'em killers on deck\n[01:50.68] Act up if you want, stick gorillas on you\n[01:53.48] Banana clips for the monkeys that been comin' at us\n[01:56.56] And they ain't runnin' up on us, they probably runnin' from us\n[01:59.76] Tattoos on my body, I need tears by my eyes\n[02:02.62] In my dirt, I admit it, but I'm still here alive\n[02:05.56] Tryna thrive, tryna vibe to survive, get the bands\n[02:08.60] Look at my closet, you gon' think I came from Afghanistan\n[02:11.64] I don't talk shit, I let the stick talk shit\n[02:14.58] Shots hit him in his chest, got him crip walkin'\n[02:17.66] I'ma limp like a pimp, that's the stick walkin'\n[02:20.62] One eye closed, when I aim like Slick Rick popped him\n[02:23.56] Shout out Herbo, that's my slime, shout out Bibby, he gon' ride\n[02:26.60] Shout out Maneski, he gon' pull up with them guns and make 'em fly\n[02:29.60] Shoutout D from the Nolia, catch 'em and shoot 'em by my side\n[02:32.62] Heatseekers in his Glizzy, you can't run and you can't hide\n[Chorus]\n[02:35.78] I'm with my nigga from the Nolia and he down to let it spark\n[02:38.74] I forgot to mention that my bitch got a AR\n[02:41.62] Got a couple lil' tools, put you in the graveyard\n[02:44.56] Short barrel AR, but it got a big bark\n[02:47.48] These ain't no .22 bullets, they leave more than a scar, boy\n[02:50.76] Hit you up like Lavagirl and leave you swimmin' like Sharkboy\n[02:53.56] From the Nolia to Chicago, we'll be down to let it spark, boy\n[02:56.76] Rifle bullets so sharp, thought I hit you with a dart, boy\n[Outro]\n[02:59.90] I don't talk shit, I let the stick talk shit\n[03:02.96] Shots to his chest, got him crip walkin'\n[03:06.10] I been gettin' high off the Skywalk shit\n[03:09.00] Then I mix it up with the Moonrock shit\n[03:12.28] Stick talk, let the stick talk shit\n[03:14.94] Shots to his chest, got him crip walkin'\n[03:18.10] I been gettin' high off the Skywalk shit\n[03:21.00] Then I mix it up with the Moonrock shit\n[03:23.36] Bitch, NLMB, shout out NLMB, man\n[03:25.50] Shout out my nigga D, man\n[03:29.98] Shout out Maneski, shout out Herbo, shout out Kyro\n[03:32.70] Shout out Bibby, shout out G-Money, nigga\n[03:35.48] NLMB the gang, nigga\n[03:36.76] Never Leave My Brothers, nigga\n[03:38.36] No Limit Muskegon Boys, nigga\n[03:42.36] Fuck-nigga, bitch\n[03:45.82] And I'm mad, nigga","words":[[0.36,0.68,"[Intro]"],[0.7,0.92,"[00:01.10]"],[1.1,2.36,"Yeah,"],[2.4,2.4,"I"],[2.46,2.62,"told"],[2.7,2.92,"slatt"],[2.96,3.0,"I'm"],[3.04,3.16,"finna"],[3.2,3.32,"talk"],[3.36,3.46,"some"],[3.58,3.78,"shit,"],[3.82,3.92,"man"],[3.94,4.24,"[00:04.76]"],[4.76,4.78,"We"],[4.84,5.1,"throwin'"],[5.14,5.42,"P's"],[5.5,5.52,"in"],[5.56,5.68,"this"],[5.76,5.92,"bitch,"],[6.0,6.12,"man"],[6.14,6.22,"[00:06.32]"],[6.32,6.62,"Throwin'"],[6.84,6.92,"L's"],[6.98,7.02,"in"],[7.06,7.18,"this"],[7.26,7.44,"bitch,"],[7.5,7.62,"man"],[7.64,7.78,"[00:08.54]"],[8.54,8.58,"And"],[8.66,8.74,"we"],[8.84,9.98,"throwin'"],[10.06,10.4,"shells"],[10.48,10.58,"in"],[10.62,10.68,"this"],[10.76,11.26,"bitch"],[11.48,11.62,"[Chorus]"],[11.64,11.66,"[00:11.76]"],[11.7,11.82,"I'm"],[11.9,11.96,"with"],[12.0,12.06,"my"],[12.1,12.24,"nigga"],[12.34,12.52,"from"],[12.58,12.64,"the"],[12.74,13.06,"Nolia"],[13.14,13.32,"and"],[13.36,13.38,"he"],[13.48,13.68,"down"],[13.72,13.76,"to"],[13.84,14.02,"let"],[14.06,14.08,"it"],[14.12,14.48,"spark"],[14.5,14.64,"[00:14.12]"],[14.74,14.74,"I"],[14.82,15.14,"forgot"],[15.2,15.26,"to"],[15.36,15.72,"mention"],[15.76,15.86,"that"],[15.92,15.94,"my"],[16.1,16.38,"bitch"],[16.52,16.7,"got"],[16.76,16.76,